ter and a handle, and a flush washes the waste down."},{"role":"stakes","text":"Sewer gas contains hydrogen sulfide, which smells like rotten eggs, and methane."},{"role":"name","text":"This is a toilet trap, behind its counter."},{"role":"name2","text":"This is a vent stack."},{"role":"myth","text":"And pushing water down is not what empties the bowl."},{"role":"mythFact","text":"It is a siphon: the bent pipe fills and pulls the whole bowl down the drain."},{"role":"congrats","text":"Congratulations, you have built a toilet."}]}